#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`alif` --- Alif Ensemble SoC functions"
msgstr ":mod:`alif` --- fungsi SoC Alif Ensemble"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``alif`` module exposes port-specific functionality for the Alif "
"Ensemble SoC, including a block-device wrapper for the on-board OSPI flash "
"and a helper to dump SoC information from the Secure Enclave services."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``alif`` mengekspos fungsionalitas khusus port untuk SoC Alif "
"Ensemble, termasuk wrapper perangkat blok untuk flash OSPI yang terpasang di"
" board dan helper untuk membuang informasi SoC dari layanan Secure Enclave."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:11
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:19
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:23
msgid ""
"Dumps device information collected from the Alif Secure Enclave services (SE"
" services) to the serial terminal."
msgstr ""
"Membuang informasi perangkat yang dikumpulkan dari layanan Alif Secure "
"Enclave (layanan SE) ke terminal serial."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:27
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:31
msgid ""
"Creates a block-device object backed by the on-board OSPI flash. This class "
"is only available when the firmware is built with OSPI support enabled."
msgstr ""
"Membuat objek perangkat blok yang didukung oleh flash OSPI yang terpasang di"
" board. Kelas ini hanya tersedia ketika firmware dibangun dengan dukungan "
"OSPI yang diaktifkan."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:35
msgid ""
"When called with no arguments, returns the default singleton object covering"
" the writable filesystem region of flash."
msgstr ""
"Ketika dipanggil tanpa argumen, mengembalikan objek singleton default yang "
"mencakup wilayah filesystem yang dapat ditulis dari flash."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:38
msgid ""
"``start`` is the byte offset into the flash storage region. Must be a "
"multiple of the flash block size and within the flash storage range. "
"Defaults to ``-1`` which means start at offset ``0``."
msgstr ""
"``start`` adalah offset byte ke dalam wilayah penyimpanan flash. Harus "
"merupakan kelipatan dari ukuran blok flash dan berada dalam rentang "
"penyimpanan flash. Defaultnya adalah ``-1`` yang berarti mulai dari offset "
"``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:42
msgid ""
"``len`` is the length in bytes of the flash region exposed by the object. "
"Must be a multiple of the flash block size and not extend past the end of "
"the flash storage region. Defaults to ``-1`` which means use all remaining "
"bytes from ``start``."
msgstr ""
"``len`` adalah panjang dalam byte dari wilayah flash yang diekspos oleh "
"objek. Harus merupakan kelipatan dari ukuran blok flash dan tidak boleh "
"melampaui akhir wilayah penyimpanan flash. Defaultnya adalah ``-1`` yang "
"berarti gunakan semua byte yang tersisa dari ``start``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:47
msgid ""
"The object also implements the buffer protocol, allowing read-only memory-"
"mapped access to the flash region via the OSPI XIP base. This makes a zero-"
"copy view of the entire region available without issuing any flash reads::"
msgstr ""
"Objek ini juga mengimplementasikan protokol buffer, memungkinkan akses "
"memory-mapped hanya-baca ke wilayah flash melalui basis OSPI XIP. Ini "
"membuat tampilan zero-copy dari seluruh wilayah tersedia tanpa mengeluarkan "
"pembacaan flash apa pun::"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:59
msgid ""
"Read bytes from the flash into ``buf``. Two overloads expose the simple and "
"extended interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Membaca byte dari flash ke dalam ``buf``\\ . Dua overload mengekspos "
"antarmuka sederhana dan diperluas:"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): reads whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk sederhana** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): membaca blok "
"penuh mulai dari indeks blok ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` harus merupakan "
"kelipatan dari ukuran blok flash."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): reads "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` has no alignment"
" constraint."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk diperluas** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): membaca"
" ``len(buf)`` byte -- tidak harus merupakan jumlah blok penuh -- mulai dari "
"byte ``offset`` dalam blok ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` tidak memiliki "
"batasan penyelarasan."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:71
msgid ""
"Returns ``0`` on success or a negative error code. Note that the standard "
"MicroPython block-device protocol returns ``None``; the ``alif`` driver "
"intentionally exposes the underlying OSPI status code so callers that bypass"
" :mod:`vfs` can react to hardware errors."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan ``0`` jika berhasil atau kode kesalahan negatif. Perhatikan "
"bahwa protokol perangkat blok MicroPython standar mengembalikan ``None``\\ ;"
" driver ``alif`` secara sengaja mengekspos kode status OSPI yang "
"mendasarinya sehingga pemanggil yang melewati :mod:`vfs` dapat bereaksi "
"terhadap kesalahan hardware."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:80
msgid ""
"Write bytes from ``buf`` to the flash. Two overloads expose the simple and "
"extended interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Menulis byte dari ``buf`` ke flash. Dua overload mengekspos antarmuka "
"sederhana dan diperluas:"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): writes whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size. Each affected block is erased automatically before "
"being written."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk sederhana** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): menulis blok "
"penuh mulai dari indeks blok ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` harus merupakan "
"kelipatan dari ukuran blok flash. Setiap blok yang terpengaruh dihapus "
"secara otomatis sebelum ditulis."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): writes "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` has no alignment"
" constraint, and **no implicit erase is performed** -- the caller must "
"ensure the affected blocks have been erased via a prior :meth:`ioctl(6, "
"block_num) <ioctl>` call."
msgstr ""
"**Bentuk diperluas** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): "
"menulis ``len(buf)`` byte -- tidak harus merupakan jumlah blok penuh -- "
"mulai dari byte ``offset`` dalam blok ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` tidak "
"memiliki batasan penyelarasan, dan **tidak ada penghapusan implisit yang "
"dilakukan** -- pemanggil harus memastikan blok yang terpengaruh telah "
"dihapus melalui panggilan :meth:`ioctl(6, block_num) <ioctl>` sebelumnya."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:95
msgid ""
"Returns ``0`` on success or a negative error code (see :meth:`readblocks` "
"for the rationale)."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan ``0`` jika berhasil atau kode kesalahan negatif (lihat "
":meth:`readblocks` untuk alasannya)."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:100
msgid ""
"Performs a block-device control operation. ``cmd`` is one of the standard "
"MicroPython ``MP_BLOCKDEV_IOCTL_*`` commands:"
msgstr ""
"Melakukan operasi kontrol perangkat blok. ``cmd`` adalah salah satu perintah"
" MicroPython standar ``MP_BLOCKDEV_IOCTL_*``\\ :"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:103
msgid "``1`` (init) --- returns ``0``."
msgstr "``1`` (init) --- mengembalikan ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:104
msgid "``2`` (deinit) --- returns ``0``."
msgstr "``2`` (deinit) --- mengembalikan ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:105
msgid "``3`` (sync) --- returns ``0``."
msgstr "``3`` (sync) --- mengembalikan ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:106
msgid "``4`` (block count) --- returns the number of blocks in the region."
msgstr "``4`` (jumlah blok) --- mengembalikan jumlah blok dalam wilayah."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:108
msgid "``5`` (block size) --- returns the flash block size in bytes."
msgstr "``5`` (ukuran blok) --- mengembalikan ukuran blok flash dalam byte."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:109
msgid ""
"``6`` (block erase) --- erases the block at index ``arg`` and returns the "
"result of the erase operation."
msgstr ""
"``6`` (hapus blok) --- menghapus blok pada indeks ``arg`` dan mengembalikan "
"hasil operasi penghapusan."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:112
msgid "Other ``cmd`` values return ``None``."
msgstr "Nilai ``cmd`` lainnya mengembalikan ``None``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:115
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanta"

#: ../../library/omv.alif.rst:120
msgid ""
"Present and set to ``True`` only when the firmware is built with USB Mass "
"Storage Class support enabled. The attribute is absent otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Ada dan diatur ke ``True`` hanya ketika firmware dibangun dengan dukungan "
"USB Mass Storage Class yang diaktifkan. Atribut ini tidak ada jika tidak."
